DESCRIPTION:Cap at 120–150 min and 60–70km at 128–155W (low Z2 only)\
 ; extend to full distance only if body battery on waking exceeds 60 AND av
 erage nightly sleep for August 11–14 exceeds 6.5 hours.\n\nReason: Given
  the ongoing sleep debt and body battery values consistently below 50 thro
 ugh late July\, jumping to a 240-min ride in week 8 carries high injury an
 d non-absorption risk — a gated reduction protects the athlete while sti
 ll building aerobic capacity.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
